    "detailed_description": "<strong>About the Game</strong><br><br>Welcome to Cactus, an exciting clicker game where each click on the cactus icon can bring you random items of various kinds for your collection! Discover a world full of amazing items!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br>Thrilling gameplay: click on the cactus and get unique items, but be careful not to get pricked!<br>Collecting: expand your collection with rare and amazing items.<br>Achievements: unlock achievements and become the best collector.<br>Marketplace: create your own economic strategy.<br>Community-driven design: contribute your ideas and participate in the creation of new items through our Discord. All items are created with the suggestions and inspiration from our community.<br>Join us and become part of the fascinating world of Cactus, where every click can bring you a treasure!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>About the Game</strong><br><br>Welcome to Cactus, an exciting clicker game where each click on the cactus icon can bring you random items of various kinds for your collection! Discover a world full of amazing items!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br>Thrilling gameplay: click on the cactus and get unique items, but be careful not to get pricked!<br>Collecting: expand your collection with rare and amazing items.<br>Achievements: unlock achievements and become the best collector.<br>Marketplace: create your own economic strategy.<br>Community-driven design: contribute your ideas and participate in the creation of new items through our Discord. All items are created with the suggestions and inspiration from our community.<br>Join us and become part of the fascinating world of Cactus, where every click can bring you a treasure!",
